<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $800 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $800 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae on Tuesday said that on June 12 it will redeem the entire $800 million principal amount of its 7.60 percent debentures that are due April 14, 2004. The issue has series number SM-2004-D.</p>
<p>Fannie Mae said it originally issued the debentures on April 11, 1994.</p>
<p>The redemption price of the debentures will be 100 percent of the principal amount plus interest accrued to the redemption date, Fannie Mae said.</p>
</text>
